          "detected at early invasive stages, it can be treated",
          "through surgery or radiotherapy, which have a high",
          "cure rate.",
          "Vaccines against HPV",
          "HPV vaccines contain the major capsid L1 proteins,",
          "which self-assemble into virus-like particles (VLP)",
          "resembling HPV. These particles do not contain viral",
          "genetic material and thus are unable to multiply,",
